  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">About our brand and products:</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.rivercard.net/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">RiverCard.net</a><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>is an officially trademarked poker lifestyle and apparel brand built by real poker players for the poker community. RiverCard® offers premium-quality hoodies, shirts, hats, jackets, and exclusive poker-inspired collections that combine luxury fashion with authentic poker culture, Vegas energy, and competitive spirit.</p><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">What makes us different:</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">RiverCard® is not just another clothing company — it is a legally registered and officially trademarked brand with real roots in the poker industry, including the well-known RiverCard Cup®. Our brand was built from years of live poker tournaments, community engagement, and authentic poker history. We focus on premium designs, limited collections, and building a strong poker lifestyle community.</p><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">How affiliates can earn:</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates earn a generous 15% commission on every qualified sale made through their custom affiliate link. Your customers and followers also receive an exclusive 10% discount code, making it easier to drive conversions and repeat sales while building your own poker audience.</p><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">How to promote us:</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates can promote RiverCard® through poker livestreams, YouTube channels, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook groups, tournaments, blogs, email marketing, and poker communities. The unique branding, bold designs, and authentic poker identity make RiverCard® highly marketable both online and in live poker environments.</p><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Other information:</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">RiverCard® is expanding beyond apparel into a larger poker lifestyle movement involving community membership, tournaments, media, entertainment, and future collaborations. Early affiliates may receive special promotional opportunities, featured partnerships, exclusive releases, and long-term growth potential alongside the RiverCard® brand.</p></div></div>",
